  "goodToKnow": "Die Mühle is a mill, powered by water (Wassermühle), wind (Windmühle) or, in the modern sense, an electric motor: die Kaffeemühle, die Pfeffermühle. In the board game Mühle (nine men's morris), you win by lining up three counters. Müller is one of the most common German surnames, from the miller's trade. In the proverb, Wer zuerst kommt, mahlt zuerst, the first to arrive gets his grain ground first."
